:"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-21T15:00:51-07:00","id":1065964,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1051923-what-kind-of-insults-would-exist-for-each-splat?p=1065959#post1065959\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Isn't it such an educational children's book? Don't act like an ass or you'll get fucking executed.</div> </div> </div> </div>More like murdered by a bunch of sadist. Though this version of Pinocchio did straight-up, no-remorse murder this story's Jiminy Cricket for trying to stop him from skipping school or something.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-21T17:56:18-07:00","id":1066071,"title":"","content":"The rest of the story was requested by the editor because it was a bit harsh so I've read. Regardless, he was only granted his wish at the very end of the story. The comparison would be to the character not to the character's story, a marionette desperate to be a &quot;real boy.&quot; Given the devotion of Promethean to become human, I think rubbing it in should be sufficiently insulting, also public perception would be they are being called a liar so bonus points. Of course, someone could try to take a positive spin on it, but the real problem would be the Promethean probably wouldn't know the reference.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1526-diggs","name":"Diggs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-21T18:58:02-07:00","id":1066089,"title":"","content":"I imagine that changelings subtly discuss and even place bets on who is more likely to be Bait (that is, sold out to the Huntsmen by their fellow changelings). They probably use euphemisms like Trophy, Jewel and other collectibles as a reference to how their Keepers took them like objects.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-30T15:47:04-07:00","id":1070896,"title":"","content":"In my game, the Vampires call Werewolves &quot;loonies&quot;... ofc that's bland when compared to what the werewolves call the vamps: &quot;stapple-removers&quot;.","signature":"","e